10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ1000115","city":"CS1030","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[71,78,51,44,49,87],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"100","reputation":"700","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1019605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1035","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[71,78,51,44,49,87],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1019605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10132","city":"CS1073","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[71,78,51,44,49,87],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"97","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1019605"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"曹魏及西晋将领、庞德之子。其父庞德被关羽所杀，他立志复仇，以此作为毕生信念。在曹魏阵营中凭借战功，官至中尉将军，封列侯。庞会于钟会邓艾二人伐蜀时参军，成为了钟会的麾下大将。蜀汉灭亡后，庞会找到并屠灭了关羽的后代家族，以此报父仇。","tc":"曹魏及西晉將領、龐德之子。其父龐德被關羽所殺，他立志復仇，以此作為畢生信念。在曹魏陣營中憑借戰功，官至中尉將軍，封列侯。龐會于鐘會鄧艾二人伐蜀時參軍，成為了鐘會的麾下大將。蜀漢滅亡后，龐會找到并屠滅了關羽的后代家族，以此報父仇。","en":"A general of Cao Wei and Western Jin, and son of Pang De. After his father Pang De was killed by Guan Yu, Pang Hui vowed to avenge him, making it his lifelong purpose. He earned distinction in the Cao Wei military, rising to the rank of Lieutenant General and being enfeoffed as a ranked marquis. Pang Hui joined the campaign to conquer Shu under Zhong Hui and Deng Ai, serving as one of Zhong Hui's chief generals. After Shu-Han fell, he tracked down and exterminated the descendants of Guan Yu's family, thus fulfilling his oath of vengeance for his father.","jp":"曹魏および西晋の将であり、龐徳の子。父の龐徳が関羽に討たれたため復讐を志し、それを生涯の信念とした。曹魏の陣営において軍功により中尉将軍に至り、列侯に封じられた。龐会は鍾会と鄧艾による蜀討伐に従軍し、鍾会麾下の大将となった。蜀漢滅亡後、龐会は関羽の後代の家族を探し出して皆殺しにし、父の仇を討った。","kr":"조위 및 서진의 장수이자 방덕의 아들이다. 아버지 방덕이 관우에게 살해당하자 복수를 다짐하고 이를 평생의 신념으로 삼았다. 조위 진영에서 전공을 세워 관직이 중위장군에 이르고 열후에 봉해졌다. 종회와 등애 두 사람이 촉을 정벌할 때 종군하여 종회의 휘하 대장이 되었다. 촉한이 멸망한 후, 관우의 후손 가문을 찾아내 몰살함으로써 아버지의 원수를 갚았다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10440","remark":"","surname":"庞","surnameTc":"龐","surnameEn":"Pang","surnameJp":"龐","surnameKr":"방","surnameOther":"","name":"会","nameTc":"會","nameEn":"Hui","nameJp":"会","nameKr":"회","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"庞会","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"219","city":"CS1035","gender":"0","rule":"71","force":"78","wise":"51","politics":"44","charm":"49","will":"87","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"10","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"3","charmTalent":"4","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"31/31/81/31/31/16/50/31","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"55","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1011705","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5000","battleSoulPoint":"6000","debateSoulPoint":"2600","strategy":"","strategy2":"","professions":"0/2/3/0/3/0/2/1/0/1/2/2/1/0/4/0/1/0/0/0/0/1/2/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"6","compatible":"43","loyalty":"0","reputation":"600","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"205","show":"219","death":"272","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1019605","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;10/1;12/1;31/1;9/1;18/1;24/1;14/3;30/1","father":"WJ10043/0","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","ot